#
# psyq-4.7-converted.zip — the community-converted PsyQ 4.7 SDK (ELF .o objects + headers,
# extracted under conv47/psyq-4_7-converted/{lib,include}; 55 objects). PROVENANCE/USE: the
# resident engine blob is PsyQ 4.7 (DetectPsyQ 4.7.0 + the DsMix/libsnd signature hit — R24),
# so Phase 12 links the resident's embedded PsyQ code (libsnd / libgte / libspu) from conv47/,
# NOT the EXE's 4.0 libs (which won't byte-match the 4.7 objects). Git already tracks these
# files (R20 backup); this file records integrity + the Phase-12 provenance. (The 4.0 .LIBs in
# lib40/ are the EXE's, used Phases 7-8.)
