# in that band; 4.6/4.7 libpad otherwise differ from 4.2.1. Kept as the nearest surviving neighbours
# until a 4.2.1/4.3 LIBPAD.LIB surfaces (task #13). The 4.5 toolkit zip (7 split archives) is unpacked
# only on demand.
