# LIB/42PATCH/J421PD.ZIP patch = "Libpad.lib version 4.2.1 for the Analog Controller (DUAL SHOCK)", SCE R&D,
# 1998-02-26, shipped with libapi.lib 4.2 + LIBPAD.H/LIBAPI.H/KERNEL.H. Extracted: tools/psyq/lib42/ (the 4.2
# LIBs + the two patch dirs) and tools/psyq/lib421/ (the J421PD payload), both gitignored/regenerable from the
# 7z; ELF via psyq_lib_split.py + psyq-obj-parser into .run/obj42/{libpad421,libapi42}. RESULT: libpad 4.2.1
# places 7/11 objects (PADENTRY PADMAIN PADCMD PADIF PADPORTD PADSEQD WAITRC2 = the whole band's pad code,
# PADMAIN 760 ins exact) and libapi 4.2 places 39/88 (the 21 band trampolines, COUNTER, L02/L03, and the
# apicard-region C112/A50/A51/A54/A65/A67/A69/FIRST/A66/PAD/A18-21/PATCH/CHCLRPAD); ALL 46 link byte-identical
# (psyq_link.py PASS). docs/psyq-worklist.md "S79 task #13". Plain libpad 4.2 (LIB/LIBPAD.LIB) places only 4.
